{
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "label": "Garry's Mod sandboxes",
    "description": "How Garry's Mod sandboxes deploy, and how to find the game.",
    "sandbox": {
        "deploy": {
            "defaultStrategy": "hardlink",
            "supportedStrategies": [
                "hardlink",
                "symlink",
                "direct"
            ],
            "modTargets": [
                {
                    "type": "engine_addon",
                    "relPath": "garrysmod/addons"
                },
                {
                    "type": "server_plugin",
                    "relPath": "garrysmod/lua/autorun"
                },
                {
                    "type": "workshop_content",
                    "relPath": "garrysmod/cache/workshop"
                }
            ],
            "notes": [
                "Addons subscribed to on the Steam Workshop are mounted by the game itself from garrysmod/cache/workshop, and are not what a sandbox deploys. What lands here is the manual half \u2014 addons downloaded rather than subscribed.",
                "A server sandbox is the more useful one for this game: garrysmod/addons is also where a dedicated server's gamemodes and its DarkRP-style content go, and there is no Workshop subscription doing it for you.",
                "Garry's Mod mounts every addon it finds, so a sandbox's load order decides only which file wins a collision. Two addons overwriting each other's Lua is reported rather than merged."
            ]
        },
        "detect": {
            "steamAppIds": [
                "4000"
            ],
            "names": [
                "Garry's Mod",
                "GarrysMod"
            ],
            "markers": [
                "garrysmod/gameinfo.txt",
                "hl2.exe",
                "gmod.exe"
            ],
            "paths": {}
        },
        "presets": [
            {
                "id": "client",
                "label": "Client",
                "description": "Addons for playing.",
                "environment": "client"
            },
            {
                "id": "server",
                "label": "Dedicated server",
                "description": "Gamemodes and content for a server you run.",
                "environment": "server",
                "strategy": "direct",
                "options": {
                    "maxPlayers": 32,
                    "tickRate": 66
                }
            }
        ],
        "options": [
            {
                "key": "maxPlayers",
                "label": "Player slots",
                "type": "int",
                "min": 1,
                "max": 128,
                "default": 32,
                "unit": "players",
                "environments": [
                    "server"
                ]
            },
            {
                "key": "tickRate",
                "label": "Tick rate",
                "description": "How many times a second the server simulates. Above 66 costs CPU for diminishing returns on most gamemodes.",
                "type": "int",
                "min": 33,
                "max": 128,
                "default": 66,
                "unit": "tick",
                "environments": [
                    "server"
                ]
            },
            {
                "key": "gamemode",
                "label": "Gamemode",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "The folder name under garrysmod/gamemodes. Empty means sandbox.",
                "environments": [
                    "server"
                ]
            },
            {
                "key": "map",
                "label": "Starting map",
                "type": "text",
                "default": "gm_construct"
            },
            {
                "key": "launchArgs",
                "label": "Additional launch arguments",
                "type": "text"
            }
        ]
    }
}
